# Agent-Logic

Charter: `src/logic/AGENTS.md`. Spec: REQ-COL-LIGHT (AABB), REQ-DIFF, REQ-MODES, REQ-SND-ITM, REQ-AI-PART (FOV).

Allowed: `src/core/*`, Three.js math primitives, audio under `public/audio`, narrow engine spawn facades.

```javascript
// ❌ INVALID
document.body.style.cursor = 'none'
import Cannon from 'cannon-es'
const step = 1 / 60

// ✅ VALID
const dt = clock.getDelta()
position.addScaledVector(velocity, dt)
const hits = boxA.intersectsBox(boxB)
```

No CSS/DOM. Difficulty is FOV/reaction/fire behavior, not a timer. AI: dot-product cone + Raycaster LOS; FSM Patrol → Investigate → Pursue → Engage.
